----- session two (restored from checkpoint) -----

The raw request (Need ...) comes from the genuine partial match and
must survive every toggle; only the policy prediction line may come
and go with the learned-memory mask, and erasure removes it for good.

you> research mode on
hyge> restoring the research checkpoint (taught rules will be recompiled and revalidated)
hyge> research mode ON
state: taught rules 3; axioms 2; dependency requests 2; intervention episodes 2; learned policies 1; residual generator enabled
you> assume axiom: (squaresum 8 15 17)
hyge> axiom recorded with provenance DOMAIN_AXIOM: (squaresum 8 15 17)
you> attempt goal: (primitivetriple 8 15 17)
